  "description": "Get into the festive spirit with this adorable birthday clip art! Inside you’ll find:\nisolated objects ( confetti, gifts, cake, candles, celebrating animals – zebra, lion, elephant and giraffe, also gifts, birthday hats, balloons, garland and bright hand drawn text “HAPPY BIRTHDAY”.\npre-made frames\npre-made wreaths\nseamless borders\nseamless patterns\npre-made compositions\nand Bonus – pre-made 4 postcards.\nPNG files, high quality, hand drawn illustrations Perfect for Birthday celebration, for wrapping paper, fabric printing, paper plates, gift boxes decor, postcards, greeting cards, invitations, stickers and etc.\nBright colors and cute illustrations make this collection especially suitable for children’s celebrations and joyful designs. Each element is carefully illustrated with love, creating a playful and heartwarming collection perfect for children’s celebrations.",
